      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能学会飞叶风暴这个招式！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD5B664F1A98DE53F698CE66B48FD94E2A62DB5F0FFF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，问题在于你是否拥有\n足够让它来割草的院子。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C95EE989857284E8E4F60662F542662E56709000A8DB3591F8BA95B83676552728349768496625B50300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且它会把割下来的草撒一地，\n还得意洋洋地耍威风，是个惹事精！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E145B834F1A628A52724E0B67657684834964924E005730FF0C000A8FD85F97610F6D0B6D0B5730800D5A0198CEFF0C662F4E2A60F94E8B7CBEFF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
