    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，它同时也是个\n会把重要文件吹飞的调皮鬼！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C5B83540C65F64E5F662F4E2A000A4F1A628A91CD898165874EF6543998DE76848C0376AE9B3CFF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "旋转洛托姆的风力！\n感觉如何？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65CB8F6C6D1B625859C6768498CE529BFF01000A611F89C959824F55FF1F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最后一只！进入冰箱的洛托姆\n被称为结冰洛托姆！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700540E4E0053EAFF018FDB516551B07BB176846D1B625859C6000A88AB79F04E3A7ED351B06D1B625859C6FF0100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "又酷又冷，我都要冻住了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53C8917753C851B7FF0C621190FD898151BB4F4F4E86FF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿4",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "结冰洛托姆的属性是电和冰！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ED351B06D1B625859C676845C5E6027662F7535548C51B0FF0100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能学会暴风雪这个招式！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD5B664F1A66B498CE96EA8FD94E2A62DB5F0FFF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它是个会用冷气把周围冻住的惹事精！\n这样是不招人喜欢的呀……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83662F4E2A4F1A752851B76C14628A546856F451BB4F4F768460F94E8B7CBEFF01000A8FD96837662F4E0D62DB4EBA559C6B22768454402026202600100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了，洛托姆的形态变化\n和特殊的马达有关～<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86FF0C6D1B625859C676845F62600153D85316000A548C72796B8A76849A6C8FBE67095173FF5E00100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿9",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说着说着洛托姆的魅力，\n不知不觉中对战就结束了呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF477408BF477406D1B625859C676849B45529BFF0C000A4E0D77E54E0D89C94E2D5BF962185C317ED3675F4E865440300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在伽勒尔地区，还有空拍洛托姆和\n洛托姆自行车之类的，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n在方方面面大显身手……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57284F3D52D25C145730533AFF0C8FD867097A7A62CD6D1B625859C6548C000A6D1B625859C681EA884C8F664E4B7C7B7684FF0C00100001BE00000A572865B965B9976297625927663E8EAB624B2026202600100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是，毕竟洛托姆基本上都是\n喜欢调皮捣蛋的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662FFF0C6BD57ADF6D1B625859C657FA672C4E0A90FD662F000A559C6B228C0376AE636386CB7684FF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把它们当作好用的电器\n恐怕是件难事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A5B834EEC5F534F5C597D7528768475355668000A60506015662F4EF696BE4E8B300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "以你的实力，说不定能驾驭\n各种形态的洛托姆来对战！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EE54F6076845B9E529BFF0C8BF44E0D5B9A80FD9A7E9A6D000A540479CD5F62600176846D1B625859C667655BF96218FF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，我赠送你一套用来\n改变洛托姆形态的型录吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C62118D6090014F604E00595775286765000A653953D86D1B625859C65F6260017684578B5F555427FF0100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你在某处捉到了野生洛托姆，\n就用一用这个型录吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F60572867D05904634952304E8691CE751F6D1B625859C6FF0C000A5C3175284E0075288FD94E2A578B5F555427300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今后开发出各种机器和电器后，\n洛托姆应该也会逐一对应的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECA540E5F0053D151FA540479CD673A5668548C75355668540EFF0C000A6D1B625859C65E948BE54E5F4F1A90104E005BF95E947684300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说，洛托姆拥有无限的可能性！\n这堪称洛托姆∞啊！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0C6D1B625859C662E5670965E09650768453EF80FD6027FF01000A8FD9582A79F06D1B625859C6221E554AFF01FF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿C",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你用洛托姆型录\n改变洛托姆的形态了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6075286D1B625859C6578B5F55000A653953D86D1B625859C676845F6260014E865417FF1F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说不定总有一天洛托姆会进入所有家电，\n大闹特闹，调皮捣蛋！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF44E0D5B9A603B67094E0059296D1B625859C64F1A8FDB5165624067095BB67535FF0C000A592795F9727995F9FF0C8C0376AE636386CBFF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "科特特～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "79D172797279FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    }
  ],
